OL,3,GNEWSADevelopers move ahead with
OL,4,A3,500-home village plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevelopers behind plans for a new
OL,7,Fvillage of about 3,500 homes between
OL,8,FYork and Selby have said they hope to
OL,9,Fapply for planning permission by the
OL,10,Fend of the year.
OL,12,FThe Escrick Park Estate has revived its
OL,13,Fplans for the village, called Heronby,
OL,14,Fafter being put on hold while North
OL,15,FYorkshire's local government was
OL,16,Freorganised.
OL,18,FAt a public event this week, some local
OL,19,Fresidents voiced fears about the
OL,20,Fproposals, including Lesley Hardisty,
OL,21,Ffrom nearby Escrick, who said she was
OL,22,F"really concerned" about extra traffic.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
