OL,3,GNEWSADevelopers move ahead with
OL,4,A3,500-home village plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Beilby Forbes Adam, from Escrick
OL,7,FPark Estate, said: "I'm not going to
OL,8,Fpretend the A19 won't remain a busy
OL,9,Froad, but a development like Heronby
OL,10,Fcan enable a series of improvements."
